WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.872
This admission example puts the previous discharge time beside the current admission.

00:00:04.872 --> 00:00:07.782
First, admissions are separated by patient.

00:00:07.782 --> 00:00:09.952
Then they are ordered by time.

00:00:09.952 --> 00:00:14.934
Lag retrieves the discharge time from the previous admission for that same patient.

00:00:15.404 --> 00:00:21.561
Once both timestamps are on the current row, we can calculate the time between encounters.

00:00:21.561 --> 00:00:29.446
The first admission for a patient has no earlier admission, so there is no previous discharge value.

00:00:29.446 --> 00:00:32.878
That missing result is expected and meaningful.
